              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yak 2:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe, Israeli, mtumishi wangu; Yakobo, niliyekuchagua; mzao wa Ibrahimu, rafiki yangu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wewe niliyekushika toka miisho ya dunia, na kukuita toka pembe zake, nikikuambia, Wewe u mtumishi wangu; nimekuchagua wala sikukutupa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.31.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kum 31:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.8.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rum 8:31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "usiogope, kwa maana mimi ni pamoja nawe; usifadhaike, kwa maana mimi ni Mungu wako; nitakutia nguvu, naam, nitakusaidia, naam, nitakushika kwa mkono wa kuume wa haki yangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.23.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kut 23:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.12.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zek 12:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tazama, wote walioona hasira juu yako watatahayarika na kufadhaika; watu washindanao nawe watakuwa si kitu, na kuangamia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Utawatafuta wala hutawaona wale wapiganao nawe; watakuwa si kitu; watakuwa kama kitu kisichokuwa, wale waliofanya vita juu yako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa maana mimi, BWANA, Mungu wako, nitakushika mkono wako wa kuume, nikikuambia, Usiogope; mimi nitakusaidia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOB.19.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ayu 19:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Usiogope, Yakobo uliye mdudu, nanyi watu wa Israeli; mimi nitakusaidia, asema BWANA, na mkombozi wako ni Mtakatifu wa Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
