          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haya, leteni maneno yenu, asema BWANA; toeni hoja zenu zenye nguvu, asema mfalme wa Yakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wayatangaze na kutujulisha yatakayokuwa; watuonyeshe mambo ya zamani, ni mambo gani, tukapate kuyatia moyoni, tukajue mwisho wake; au wamdhihirishie yatakayotokea baadaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:23"
          },
          "items": [
